WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Hi, I'm Sonia and I'm here at South Woodford Blueprint Fitness.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:08.720
A couple of years ago, I had a pretty bad medical, realised that I was spending all my time working

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:15.440
and on the kids and no time on myself, so I decided to make fitness a priority for me.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:21.360
I am in ill-disciplined and I need motivation and so therefore I was looking for a PT,

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.280
but a one-on-one PT session where someone's kind of screaming in your face and you have to

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:30.960
chat a lot wasn't for me, so a small group PT is perfect. You get the individual support,

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.560
but you get to train with people, which for me is really motivating.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:38.080
Which is fantastic here. They've all got their own way of training,

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.920
but they're all really supportive. They will come, they'll correct my form,

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:48.400
they will push me if I am taking it easy on any given day or if they think I've gone too far,

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:53.440
they'll pull it back or adapt it. I actually had major surgery in March of this year and

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.200
all of them helped me kind of get back into the gym and

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.640
adapted the exercises so that I could get back in my feet.

